<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ZEP" style="id">- Gofa Full Bible Latin Version Final</book>
  <para style="h">Sofonaasa Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Sofonaasa Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="toc3">Sofo</para>
  <para style="toc2">Sofonaasa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Sofonaasa Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="imt">Gaatha Qofa</para>
  <para style="ip">Sofonaasa maxaafay xaafetiday, Yihudinne Yerusalaamey Godaa gallasan yaanaw de7iya daganthiya pirdaba odanaasa. Maxaafay, asa koche ubba bolla Xoossa pirdi yaanaysi attonaba gidikoka (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ZEP 1:2">1:2</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 3:8">3:8</ref></char>), ubbaafe aathidi I nagara gaason Yihuda bolla yaanaw de7iya pirda odees (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ZEP 1:4-18">1:4-18</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 3:1-7">3:1-7</ref></char>). Hessa gisho, Xoossa pirda gallasay gakanaape sinthe asay banta nagara paaxidi, Xoosse koyana mela asaa denthethees (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ZEP 2:1-3">2:1-3</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Sofonaasi, ichashu allaga biittata bolla Xoossay pirdanaysa odees. Entika, Filisxeeme, Amoone, Moo7abe, Tophenne Asoore (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ZEP 2:4-15">2:4-15</ref></char>). Nabey Yerusalaame nagara odidaape guye, Xoossay ba asaa shiishanaysa, wozanaysanne zaaridi oorathanaysa odees (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ZEP 3:9-20">3:9-20</ref></char>). “Hinteno, biittan de7iya ashketo, iya kiita naagiya ubbato, Godaa koyte; xillotethi koyte; ashketethi koyte. Ooni eri Godaa hanqo gallas hinte attona aggeketa” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="iot">Maxaafa Ayfe Qofata</para>
  <para style="io1">Godaa gallasan Yihudinne Isra7eeley pirdetana <char style="ior">(<ref loc="ZEP 1:1-18">1:1-18</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Xoossako simo <char style="ior">(<ref loc="ZEP 2:1-3">2:1-3</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Hara kawotethata bolla yaana pirda <char style="ior">(<ref loc="ZEP 2:4-15">2:4-15</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yihudinne hara kawotethati Godaako simmana <char style="ior">(<ref loc="ZEP 3:1-20">3:1-20</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ZEP 1" />
  <para style="s1">Godaa Pirda Gallasa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:1" />Amoone na7ay Iyosyaasi Yihudan kawotida wode Sofoniyaasako yida Godaa qaalay haysa. Sofoniyaasi Kuusha na7aa; Kuushi Gadalla na7a; Gadalli Amaare na7a; Amaarey Hizqiyaasa na7aa. <verse eid="ZEP 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:2" />“Taani biitta bolla de7iyaba ubbaa dhaysana. <verse eid="ZEP 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:3" />Asenne mehee, salo kafotanne abba molota dhaysana. Iita asata shira yeggana; asa zare biitta bollafe dhaysana” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="ZEP 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yihuda Bolla Yaana pirda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:4" />“Yihudaninne Yerusalaamen de7iya ubbaa seeranaw ta kushiya denthana. Ba7aale eeqa goyinneysatanne iya haggaaziya kahineta he bessaafe dhaysana. <verse eid="ZEP 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:5" />Keetha bolla keyidi awas, ageenasinne xoolintotas goyinneyisata taani dhaysana. Godaa goyinnishenne iya sunthan caaqishe Moloka geetetiya eeqa sunthan caaqeyisata taani dhaysana. <verse eid="ZEP 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:6" />Tana kaalo aggidi guye simmidaysata, tana koyboonaysatanne tana oychiboonayisata taani dhaysana” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="ZEP 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:7" />Godaa gallasay matida gisho, Ubbaa Haariya Godaa sinthan si77i giite! Goday yarshuwa giigisis; qassi ba xeegida imathata geeshshis.<verse eid="ZEP 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:8" />“Godaa yarshuwa gallas halaqata, kawa naytanne allaga biitta ma7o ma77ida ubbaa taani seerana. <verse eid="ZEP 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:9" />He gallas allaga biitta asatada, eeqa goyinneysatanne banta godaa keethaa geellatethaninne cimon kuntheyisata taani seerana” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="ZEP 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:10" />“He gallas Molo Pengiya baggara waasoy, katamaas nam7antho shaahuwan yeehonne zumata bolla gita dom7e girsi si7etana. <verse eid="ZEP 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:11" />Hinteno, katamaas garsa baggan de7eysato, yeekite. Yan zal7iya ubbay dhayidosona; bira oykidaysati hayqi wuridosona. <verse eid="ZEP 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:12" />He gallas taani xompe oythada Yerusalaame gidduwa koyana. Hirgi bayna wodhi uttidi banta wozanan, ‘Goday lo77oka iitaka’ geyisata taani seerana. <verse eid="ZEP 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:13" />Enta shaloy bonqetana; enta keethay laaletana. Enti keethe keexana, shin he keethan dookona; woyne tokana, shin he woyniya uyokona” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="ZEP 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Godaa Gita Gallasa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:14" />“Godaa gita gallasay matis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 1:14">ellesidi gakis.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEP 1:14">Godaa gallasay camo gallas;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 1:14">He gallas mino olanchotika waaso goochana.<verse eid="ZEP 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:15" />He gallasay hanqo gallas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 1:15">he gallasay metonne un7a gallas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 1:15">dhayonne laaletetha gallas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 1:15">dhumanne caagana gallas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 1:15">shaaranne sakana dhuma gallas gidana.<verse eid="ZEP 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:16" />He gallasay diretida katamata bolla,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 1:16">adussa gimbeta bolla ola moyzey punetana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 1:16">giigeta giya waasoy si7etana.<verse eid="ZEP 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:17" />Enti tana qohida gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 1:17">qooqeda tattafana gakanaw, enta bolla meto ehana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEP 1:17">Enta suuthay di7oda goggana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 1:17">enta ahay pitoda yegetana.<verse eid="ZEP 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:18" />Godaa hanqo gallas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 1:18">enta biraynne enta worqay enta ashshena.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEP 1:18">I sa7an de7iya ubbaa qoponna dhaysana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 1:18">biitta ubbay iya hanquwa taman meetetana” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="ZEP 1:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEP 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ZEP 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:1" />Hinteno, yeelli bayna asaw, ane issife shiiqite! <verse eid="ZEP 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:2" />Carkoy punnidi efiya baanada hanonna de7ishin, yashshiya Godaa hanqoy hinte bolla wodhonna de7ishin, Godaa hanqo suulaa gallasay hinte bolla yoonna de7ishin Godaako simmite. <verse eid="ZEP 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:3" />Hinteno, biittan de7iya ashketo, iya kiita naagiya ubbato, Godaa koyte; xillotethaa koyte; ashketethi koyte. Ooni eri Godaa hanqo gallas hinte attonna aggeketa.<verse eid="ZEP 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Filisxeeme Bolla Yaana Pirda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:4" />Gaaza katamay ona gidana; Asqaloona katamay baysa gidana. Ashdooda katama asay seeta gallas goodettana; Eqroona katamay shodetana. <verse eid="ZEP 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:5" />Hinteno, abba gaxan de7iya Keltaaweto, hintena ayye! Neno, Filisxeemeti de7iya Kanaane biittaw, Godaa pirday ne bolla yees. Taani nena dhaysana; issi asika attenna. <verse eid="ZEP 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:6" />Abbaa gaxan de7iya hinte biittay mehe heemetiya bessi, henthanchoti de7iya bessinne mehe dara gidana. <verse eid="ZEP 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:7" />Yihuda asape attidaysati abba gaxan de7iya bessaa laattana; enti yan heemmana. Sa7ay qammiya wode enti Asqaloona kataman de7iya keethatan aqana. Goday enta Xoossay entaba qopana; I enta zaaridi naannisana.<verse eid="ZEP 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Moo7abenne Amoone Pirdetetha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:8" />Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday, Isra7eele Xoossay, “Taani Moo7abe tooshiyanne Amoone cashshaa si7as. Enti ta asaa waatidi toochidaakonne enta biitta ekanaw waatidi mandidaako ta erayis. <verse eid="ZEP 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:9" />Hessa gisho, ta de7o sunthan caaqayis; Moo7abey Sodoomeda hanana; Amooney Gamoorada hanana. Enti merinaw maxine ollanne agunthi ma77ida bazzo gidana. Ta asape attidaysati enta shaluwa bonqana; enta biitta laattana” yaagees.<verse eid="ZEP 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:10" />Enti Ubbaafe Wolqaama Godaa asaa toochida gishonne cayida gisho, enta bolla metoy gakana. <verse eid="ZEP 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:11" />Enta biittan de7iya xoossata I dhaysiya wode Goday entana yashisana. Sa7an de7iya kawotethatan de7iya asa ubbay ba de7iya bessan iya goyinnana.<verse eid="ZEP 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:12" />Hinteno, Tophe asaw, hinte ta mashshan hayqana.<verse eid="ZEP 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Soore Bolla Yaana Pirda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:13" />I ba kushiya pudeha bagga yeddidi Asoore biitta dhaysana. Qassi Nanawe katamaa mela bazzoda baysa bessi oothana. <verse eid="ZEP 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:14" />Mehe wudeynne biittan de7iya do7ati ubbay yan hemetana; guttoynne quxarey laaletida gimbiya giddon daana. Enta qaalay maskooteranne pengiyara si7etana; ziga tuuqeti kallotana. <verse eid="ZEP 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:15" />“Taape attishin, hari baawa” yaagidi otortidi de7ida katamay ha77i waanidi do7ati aqiya bessi gididee? Iya matara aadhiya ubbay banta kushiya baqishe, “Poora!” gaana.<verse eid="ZEP 2:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEP 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ZEP 3" />
  <para style="s1">Yerusalaame Wozetethi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:1" />Makallanchuwas, tunidaysasinne ba deriya un7ethida Yerusalaame katamaa ayye! <verse eid="ZEP 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:2" />I oonaka kiitetenna; seerin simmenna; Godan ammanetena; ba Xoossaako shiiqenna. <verse eid="ZEP 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:3" />Iya halaqati gudiya gaammo mela; iya daynnati demmidaba wontos ashshona ubbaa midi ongiya omarsa suudhume mela. <verse eid="ZEP 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:4" />Iya nabeti otoranchonne genancho; iya kahineti geeshshaa tuniseyisata; enti Godaa higgiya mirqoosona. <verse eid="ZEP 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:5" />Shin iya giddon de7iya Goday xillo; I bala oothenna. Wonta wonta I xillo pirdees; gallas gallas hessa aggenna. Gidoshin, yan de7iya geellay yeella erenna.<verse eid="ZEP 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:6" />“Taani kawotethata dhaysas; enta gimbeta laallas. Enta katamata issi doonna baysa biitta oothas; enta ogeta asi kanthonna bazzo oothas. <verse eid="ZEP 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:7" />Taani haysa ubbaa oothada, ‘Ta asay tana bonchana; ta seera ekana; ta kiittidaba dogenna’ yaagas. Shin enti kasepe aadhidi iitidosona; banta oosuwan tunidosona” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="ZEP 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:8" />“Ane taani pirdiya gallasay gakanaw guuthu naagite. Taani deretanne kawotethata shiishanaw qofa qachas; ta hanquwa suulaa enta bolla gussana; biittay kumethi ta hanquwa taman xuugetana.<verse eid="ZEP 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:9" />“He wode asa ubbay geeshsha oda odetana mela oothana. Enti ubbay Godaa sunthaa xeegana; issife iyaw goyinnana. <verse eid="ZEP 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:10" />Laaletida asay, tana tuma goyinneysati, Tophe shaafatape hefinthan de7eysati taw imota ehana. <verse eid="ZEP 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:11" />Otoreysatanne ceeqeteyisata ta hinte giddofe dhaysiya gisho, he wode hinte ta bolla oothida oosuwa gaason yeellateketa. Hizape guye hinte ta geeshsha zumaa bolla otorteketa. <verse eid="ZEP 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:12" />Taani hinte giddofe bantana kawusheysatanne aadata ashshana; enti Godaa sunthan ammanetana. <verse eid="ZEP 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:13" />Isra7eele asaape attidaysati iitabaa oothokona; wordo odetokona; enta inxarsan cimoy bentenna. Hessa gisho, enti midi kallidi saron daana; enta yashisiyabay baawa” yaagees.<verse eid="ZEP 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:14" />Xiyoone na7e, mazmuriya yexa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 3:14">Isra7eele asaw, ililite!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEP 3:14">Yerusalaame na7e, ne polo wozanaape ufayta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 3:14">hashshu ga!<verse eid="ZEP 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:15" />Goday hinte bolla pirdida pirdaa aggis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 3:15">hinte morketa diggis.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEP 3:15">Goday, Isra7eele kawoy hinte giddon de7ees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 3:15">hizape guye hintena yashisiyabay baawa.<verse eid="ZEP 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:16" />He gallas enti Yerusalaame haysada yaagana:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 3:16">“Xiyoone, yayyofa! Ne kushey argaacopo.<verse eid="ZEP 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:17" />Goday, ne Xoossay ne giddon de7ees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 3:17">I new xoono immiya olanchuwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEP 3:17">I nenan ufaytana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 3:17">ba siiquwan nena oorathana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEP 3:17">Asay ba7aale gallas mazmure yexeysada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 3:17">I nenan ufayteysa mazmure yexidi bessaana” yaagana.<verse eid="ZEP 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:18" />Goday haysada yaagees:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 3:18">“Hizape guye ne bolla dhayoy gakonnaada oothana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 3:18">ne yeella diggana.<verse eid="ZEP 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:19" />He wode taani nena un7ethidaysata ubbaa seerana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 3:19">wobbeta ashshana; laaletidaysata shiishana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEP 3:19">Enti yeellatida bessan zaarada bonchana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 3:19">enta yeella bonchoninne saban laammana.<verse eid="ZEP 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:20" />He wode taani hintena shiishana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 3:20">hintena issife zaarada shiishana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEP 3:20">Taani hintena naannisiya wode,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 3:20">hinte ha sa7an de7iya asa ubbaa matan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEP 3:20">bonchetidaysatanne eretidaysata gidana” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="ZEP 3:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEP 3" />
</usx>